# Cast — unaligned
#
# Props and figures that belong to no faction: the Recycle Bin that wipes your
# record, the Search Oracle that autocompletes your fate, the Profile Mirror
# that shows you to yourself, and the Banned — a ghost nobody could log out.
# No badge, so they use the bare `Scanner(beat)` router straight.

CHARACTER Recycle_Bin is Scanner(clear_history)
CHARACTER Search_Oracle is Scanner(ask_oracle)
CHARACTER Profile_Mirror is Scanner(check_profile)
CHARACTER The_Banned is Scanner(banned_ghost)
